    {
      "id": 2627522787,
      "postUrl": "https://t.me/medmannews/47611?single",
      "source": {
        "title": "Mediterranean Man",
        "handle": "medmannews",
        "verified": false,
        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/iImLsYv38sl2P1BgkL7l7IKwS_STW1YF9odyY6eadDFDVrl6q1pAcF73LwEUZsnhriyOjegXTKN_IBYlxM53_qiZtvjzHPqT0E3WU6pK-lwAbKhr6ge3T2mOIxjc6T4AAmn9-jRa1SLwR1vqtBYuAYX2cID7_-06EV8wVB_9IMaS1uYtuUvtYTBmLQzlMXE63MtNzWXAi7ohSBNe3UBltCTx403CVBCwH0OIUuEgHnsACxy_Et1MjgEk43Lwkzlq_qvHsBCU1n_AGs82PXhOMk6ZCXU8t9eNGaiEZItIGhNe_WYvjX_WcyIy0rnvD3EnPU6cGPPnFJV5jk6b5y3TeA.jpg"
      },
      "sourceId": "eg:medmannews",
      "sourceCountryCode": "eg",
      "contentType": "text",
      "media": [],
      "hasMediaInOriginal": false,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "⚡️🇺🇸 Yesterday, the S.S United states was turned into an artificial reef off the coast of Florida. \n\nThe Luxury yet austere liner was built with dual purpose in mind. \nAt the hight of the cold war, the need to have fast troop transport ship ready to use translated in a sleek hull and two westinghouse turbines, achieving a top speed of 40 knots/75km an hour in seas trials, a speed record never shattered since.\n\nIt's maiden voyage between New York and Le Havre  accomplished in just under 3 days 11 hours earned it the blue ribbon, the prestigious trophy for the fastest  crossing of the north atlantic established in 1838. \nThe SS United States remains it's  last holder.\n\nIn march of 1963, it had the honour of ferrying the  Mona Lisa back to France.\n\nIts career would be put to a premature halt by 1969, when air transit became common denominator and liners turned a deficit.\n\nFrom here 57 years of failed attempt at repurposing her and rusting away docked in Philadelphia.\n\n@medmannews",
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "@medmannews",
          "url": "https://t.me/medmannews"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-11-12T22:30:45.246Z",
      "expiresAt": "2026-11-14T22:30:45.246Z",
      "ttlHours": 48,
      "mediaRefreshedAt": "2026-11-12T22:30:45.246Z",
      "tag": "war",
      "tags": [
        "war",
        "politics"
      ],
